/x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2122752733497463210"}, {"author_id": "731917653506318336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:04:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122752662399500564"], "id": "2122752662399500564", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 4304, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "NEW: OpenAI released GPT-6.2 Astra and GPT-6.2 Sol, rolling out now across paid plans.\n\nOpenAI rates Astra as the first public model to reach “High” on AI self-improvement, its label for a model that acts like an extra research engineer for each OpenAI researcher.\n\nAstra on Max", "url": "https://x.com/TheRundownAI/status/2122752662399500564"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122747512671129600"]}, "author_id": "1743487864934162432", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:56:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122750634210529569"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 172, "id": "4398626122", "start": 165, "username": "OpenAI"}]}, "id": "2122750634210529569", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 419, "impression_count": 364008, "like_count": 2749, "quote_count": 136, "reply_count": 116, "retweet_count": 243}, "text": "OpenAI’s release of GPT-6.2 Astra and GPT-6.2 Sol delivers the #2 model in the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index and most of the Cost per Task Pareto frontier\n\n@OpenAI's GPT-6.2 Astra is priced at $8/$40, 20% below GPT-6 Astra, and cached input drops to $0.40 from $1.00 per https://t.co/rfr2I9sShd", "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2122750634210529569"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122750205506596864"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:55:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122750398201205042"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 326, "start": 303, "url": "https://t.co/PmTZU3Mgu2"}]}, "id": "2122750398201205042", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 2875, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122496000510320659", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Dario Amodei talks about Anthropic’s retention rates to JP Morgan CEO Jamie Dimon during Anthropic IPO reoadshow.\n\nMore people move to Anthropic from other companies than leave it, and all 7 co-founders are still there. Even people who leave often come back.\n\n----\nFull video on https://t.co/ABUWfQ5FuW https://t.co/PmTZU3Mgu2", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122750398201205042"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122720739661172736"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2122727083600380392"]}, "author_id": "731917653506318336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:29:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122743985818960245"], "id": "2122743985818960245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4315, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "PREVIEW: Runway teased Diffusion-UI, a research app where an AI model generates an interface in real-time as a user clicks or types.  https://t.co/JMumTzqt7C", "url": "https://x.com/TheRundownAI/status/2122743985818960245"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122742544576679936"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:23:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122742556635377890"], "id": "2122742556635377890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2367, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "This paper finds that a low benchmark score can be manufactured precisely, so a low score alone says little about what a model can do.\n\nSafety tests often read a low score on a dangerous-capability probe as reassurance. But a low score can come from a model being held back, so https://t.co/Us4Negq7Qf", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122742556635377890"}, {"author_id": "1825243643529027584", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:59:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122736279351857513", "212273639772361114