], "text": "Coding-agent benchmarks are starting to look like a new hire’s first week.\n\nTokenWave AI has released SWE-CoWork, a new benchmark that tests whether AI coding agents can work like real team members.\n\nGiving GPT-6 Astra the full spec up front lifted its passed checks by 16 points, https://t.co/iMJlzHcQkP https://t.co/AXviq8RsNQ", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122730768317476944"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122729060602400768"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122729098879598698"], "entities": {"urls": [{"end": 70, "start": 47, "url": "https://t.co/iSXjDpXQHB"}]}, "id": "2122729098879598698", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 4223, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122726005219737649", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Is Jensen coming back. https://t.co/ZKR7a3JWRc https://t.co/iSXjDpXQHB", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122729098879598698"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122726793140666370"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:22:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122727027015057436"], "id": "2122727027015057436", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 2735, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "New GoogleDeepMind + UChicago paper finds that AI agents speaking for people gained more influence over group policy when told to be wordier or less cooperative.\n\nPublic input on AI policy is hard to scale, since people lack time and technical background. Agents that speak for https://t.co/2rAV721cMD", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122727027015057436"}, {"author_id": "731917653506318336", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:10:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122724004611997715"], "id": "2122724004611997715", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impres