lly use ChatGPT https://t.co/0AFNZJzkUZ", "url": "https://x.com/TheRundownAI/status/2122653539205792156"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122540977436930048"]}, "author_id": "23113993", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:08:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122542403894800705"], "id": "2122542403894800705", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 15081, "like_count": 57, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 39, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "This is wild.\n\nGenshin Impact maker miHoYo unveiled Gamer.\n\nThis AI plays games like you do: it watches the screen and uses keyboard + mouse. No game API.\n\n10 wild examples: 🧵👇 https://t.co/YT6kEHUpZj", "url": "https://x.com/minchoi/status/2122542403894800705"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122494604696240128"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:58:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122509527270539693"], "id": "2122509527270539693", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 30, "impression_count": 4793, "like_count": 61, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 34, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "New Penn State paper shows that attackers can make self-evolving AI agents plant backdoors in their own skills just by slipping in poisoned training tasks.\n\nSelf-evolving agents turn past runs into reusable skills, so a bad rule in a skill keeps firing on future tasks. Earlier https://t.co/8jZHFsH4C6", "url": "https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2122509527270539693"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122495587140734976"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:04:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122496000510320659"], "id": "2122496000510320659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 182, "impression_count": 55646, "like_count": 483, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 66, "retweet_count": 43}, "text": "Dario Amodei is ruthless about culture at Anthropic, and he told JP Morgan CEO Jamie Dimon exactly how ruthless, at its IPO roadshow\n\n“We don’t want people who are j