02723", "created_at": "2026-11-17T17:03:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122737484404756945"], "id": "2122737484404756945", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 892, "impression_count": 1289577, "like_count": 1173, "quote_count": 57, "reply_count": 224, "retweet_count": 313}, "text": "Today we’re launching Scout, the AI assistant built for sales.\n\nIt lives in your Slack and text. It works every account in your book and tells you who to talk to, why now, and what to say.\n\nThen learns how you sell and drafts the next best action to take in your voice: an email, https://t.co/lfap87zux0"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122495587140734976"]}, "author_id": "2588345408", "created_at": "2026-11-17T01:04:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122496000510320659"], "id": "2122496000510320659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 182, "impression_count": 55646, "like_count": 483, "quote_count": 14, "reply_count": 66, "retweet_count": 43}, "text": "Dario Amodei is ruthless about culture at Anthropic, and he told JP Morgan CEO Jamie Dimon exactly how ruthless, at its IPO roadshow\n\n“We don’t want people who are jerks. \nWe don’t want people who try to steal the show and don’t work well with others. \nWe don’t want people who https://t.co/iclQBD2wnA"}, {"created_at": "2026-11-17T16:22:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122727083600380392"], "id": "2122727083600380392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 202, "impression_count": 26089, "like_count": 326, "quote_count": 20, "reply_count": 28, "retweet_count": 36}, "text": "Introducing Diffusion-UI.\n\nInteractive software where every pixel is generated by a real-time model. Today, we're sharing a new research application that lets generated interfaces use structured data, maintain states and generate controls.\n\nHere’s an early look: https://t.co/M5PB5RyOaS"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122721563875356672"]}, "author_id": "1765633660588576768", "created_at": "2026-11-17T16:00:34.000Z", "edit_histo